\i0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Converts \i aFont\i0  using the settings in the receiver, with the aid of the shared NSFontManager if necessary, and returns the converted font. If \i aFont\i0  can\'27t be converted it\'27s returned unchanged.\
